# Build-time public configuration for CI.
#
# Every value here is already shipped to the browser in the client bundle
# (the Supabase anon key is public by design — Row Level Security is what
# protects the data), so keeping them in the repo exposes nothing new and
# means CI needs no configuration for them.
#
# Real secrets are NOT here and must never be: SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY,
# ADMIN_EMAIL and the R2_* keys are runtime variables configured in the
# Cloudflare Pages project.

